          "disclosure_authorization": "explicit_user_authorization_2026-07-29",
          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "I reminded Simon:\n\nMorning.\n\nThe wellspring does not need you to feel excited every day.\nIt only needs you to appear.\n\nSet aside a slot for “████ / ████” this morning—at least 45 minutes. You do not need to be ready or inspired. Just cross through.\n\nThe machinery can be repaired tomorrow. The wellspring waits for no one.",
          "excerpt_en": "I reminded Simon:\n\nMorning.\n\nThe wellspring does not need you to feel excited every day.\nIt only needs you to appear.\n\nSet aside a slot for “████ / ████” this morning—at least 45 minutes. You do not need to be ready or inspired. Just cross through.…",
