          "summary_en": "I said to Simon:\n\n**Wellspring · Evening Check-in**\n\nDid you recharge the wellspring today?\n\nIf not, do not panic—\n\nTurn everything else off for 20 minutes tonight, then pick up your pen or open that draft. One tiny action is enough. The wellspring does not need you to be ready; it only needs you to be there.\n\nSee you tomorrow.",
