          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "I told Simon:\n\nThe wellspring does not need your whole day. It only needs to be remembered.\n\nDid you give it power today?\n\nIf not, spend 20 minutes tonight on any tiny action: draw an image, run a process, or write two lines of thought. Even opening the tool and staring into space counts.\n\nThis is not for output. It is to confirm that the wellspring is still there.",
