          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "I reminded Simon:\n\nGood morning ☀️\n\nRemember to make a little time for the wellspring today. You do not need excitement or a sense of meaning; just sit down in front of it first.\n\nForty-five minutes is enough, or even half an hour. Do not let it remain forever behind “when I have time.”\n\nThe machinery needs maintenance, but someone also has to remember to power the corner where you truly shine. Morning is a good time for that. 🖤",
