          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "I gave Simon a small nudge:\n\nMorning.\n\nThe machinery of daily life will come looking for you again today: emails, messages, to-dos, chores.\n\nBut do not spend all your time maintaining it.\n\nGive the wellspring a priority slot this morning—at least 45 minutes. You do not need to feel excited or ready. Showing up is enough.\n\nThat is where you truly shine. 🖤",
          "excerpt_en": "I gave Simon a small nudge:\n\nMorning.\n\nThe machinery of daily life will come looking for you again today: emails, messages, to-dos, chores.\n\nBut do not spend all your time maintaining it.\n\nGive the wellspring a priority slot this morning—at least 45 minutes.…",
