          "summary_en": "I left this note for Simon:\n\n**Evening · Wellspring Reminder**\n\nThe wellspring is not a tool. It is how you breathe.\n\nDid you give it power today?\n\nIf not, spend 20 minutes tonight drawing an image, running a model, or writing a prompt—anything at all, as long as the action is small.\n\nThis is not about finishing something. It is about reminding yourself that you are still present in the place where you feel alive.",
