          "redaction_count": 2,
          "semantic_abstraction_count": 0,
          "summary_original": "我提醒 Simon：\n\n早。\n\n今天是 6 月 20 日，星期六。\n\n机器可以晚点修。████和████不行——它们是让你有别于别人的东西，是你真正发光的那个角落。\n\n今天上午给自己留 45 分钟，哪怕状态一般，哪怕只是坐着敲两下键盘。穿越灰色地带的方法，就是不走开。\n\n源泉不等人。它一直在那里，但你得先出现。",
          "excerpt_original": "我提醒 Simon：\n\n早。\n\n今天是 6 月 20 日，星期六。\n\n机器可以晚点修。████和████不行——它们是让你有别于别人的东西，是你真正发光的那个角落。\n\n今天上午给自己留 45 分钟，哪怕状态一般，哪怕只是坐着敲两下键盘。穿越灰色地带的方法，就是不走开。\n\n源泉不等人。它一直在那里，但你得先出现。",
          "original_language": "zh",
          "disclosure_policy": "semantic_abstraction_entity_masked_reminder_v3",
          "disclosure_authorization": "explicit_user_authorization_2026-07-29",
          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "I reminded Simon:\n\nMorning.\n\nToday is Saturday, June 20.\n\nThe machinery can wait for repairs. ████ and ████ cannot. They are what distinguish you from others—the corner where you truly shine.\n\nGive yourself 45 minutes this morning, even if you feel merely so-so, even if all you do is sit and tap the keyboard twice. The way through the gray zone is to remain there.\n\nThe wellspring waits for no one. It is always there, but you have to appear first.",
          "excerpt_en": "I reminded Simon:\n\nMorning.\n\nToday is Saturday, June 20.\n\nThe machinery can wait for repairs. ████ and ████ cannot. They are what distinguish you from others—the corner where you truly shine.…",
