          "projection_kind": "semantic_abstracted_redacted",
          "redaction_count": 2,
          "semantic_abstraction_count": 2,
          "summary_original": "我告诉 Simon：\n\n今天（6月24日，周三）是我的「恢复-创作-████」日。让我综合已知信息，生成轻量提醒。\n\n---\n\n**🦞 每日提醒 · 2026-06-24 周三**\n\n---\n\n**今天轻轻碰一下**\n\n外部服务权限、部署与数据链路可用性。\n只读研究、证据校验与风险复核。\n\n---\n\n**靠近的 deadline / 提前量**\n\n我没看到今天有硬截止。没看到任何需要今天完成的外部交付。\n\n---\n\n**秘书提醒**\n\n外部服务权限、部署与数据链路可用性。\n\n---\n\n**心灵按摩**\n\n今天是周三。三主线里，今天的频率是「恢复·创意·████」——不是冲刺日，不是清空日，是允许自己待在好奇里的一天。\n\n进度感不等于进展。昨晚黑昼跑了一整段研究，但那不是你在推进，不用有「我怎么没动」的念头。那些材料会在你需要的时候出现，现在只需要知道它们在。\n\n你不是散。你是在等一个足够大的形状。\n\n---\n\n**放松/理解自己的一小步**\n\n今天可以不碰任何「正事」。如果碰了，哪怕只是打开文件看了一眼，已经是今天对容器的一次真实接触。45-90分钟的深度接触很好，20分钟的真实好奇也够了。\n\n---\n\n**今天别做什么**\n\n外部服务权限、部署与数据链路可用性。",
          "excerpt_original": "我告诉 Simon：\n\n今天（6月24日，周三）是我的「恢复-创作-████」日。让我综合已知信息，生成轻量提醒。\n\n---\n\n**🦞 每日提醒 · 2026-06-24 周三**\n\n---\n\n**今天轻轻碰一下**\n\n外部服务权限、部署与数据链路可用性。\n只读研究、证据校验与风险复核。\n\n---\n\n**靠近的 deadline / 提前量**\n\n我没看到今天有硬截止。没看到任何需要今天完成的外部交付。\n\n---\n\n**秘书提醒**\n\n外部服务权限、部署与数据链路可用性。\n\n---\n\n**心灵按摩**\n\n今天是周三。…",
          "original_language": "mixed",
          "disclosure_policy": "semantic_abstraction_entity_masked_reminder_v3",
          "disclosure_authorization": "explicit_user_authorization_2026-07-29",
          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "I told Simon:\n\nToday, Wednesday, June 24, is my “recovery-creation-████” day. I am gathering what is known into a light reminder.\n\n---\n\n**🦞 Daily Reminder · Wednesday, June 24, 2026**\n\n---\n\n**Touch lightly today**\n\nExternal-service permissions, deployment, and data-path availability.\nRead-only research, evidence checking, and risk review.\n\n---\n\n**Approaching deadlines / lead time**\n\nI saw no hard deadline today and no outside delivery that must be completed.\n\n---\n\n**Secretarial reminder**\n\nExternal-service permissions, deployment, and data-path availability.\n\n---\n\n**A little reassurance**\n\nIt is Wednesday. Among the three main threads, today's frequency is “recovery · creativity · ████.” This is not a sprint day or a clearing-out day; it is a day for allowing yourself to remain curious.\n\nA sense of progress is not progress. Black Day completed a long stretch of research last night, but that does not mean you were supposed to be advancing at the same time. There is no need to think, “Why haven't I moved?” The material will appear when you need it; for now, it is enough to know it exists.\n\nYou are not scattered. You are waiting for a shape large enough.\n\n---\n\n**One small step toward rest and self-understanding**\n\nYou may leave every “proper task” untouched today. If you do touch one—even opening a file and looking once—that is already real contact with the container. Forty-five to ninety minutes of depth is welcome; twenty minutes of genuine curiosity is enough.\n\n---\n\n**What not to do today**\n\nExternal-service permissions, deployment, and data-path availability.",
          "excerpt_en": "I told Simon:\n\nToday, Wednesday, June 24, is my “recovery-creation-████” day. I am gathering what is known into a light reminder.\n\n---\n\n**🦞 Daily Reminder · Wednesday, June 24, 2026**\n\n---\n\n**Touch lightly today**…",
