          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "I told Simon:\n\n**Wellspring evening reminder · 17:30**\n\nDid you charge it today?\n\nEven twenty minutes is enough—carve one stroke, draw one line, let the model chase one thought.\n\nIf not, add one smallest move tonight. Minimal is enough.\n\nThe wellspring does not wait.",
