          "summary_original": "我把这句话留给 Simon：\n\n早。\n\n生活机器今天又会找你麻烦的——邮件、日程、待办，它们永远在排队。\n\n但别让它们把今天所有电力都吸走。\n\n████那边，45 分钟，上午优先。你知道那才是真正让你发光的地方。\n\n不是为了产出，不是为了进度，**就是给它供电本身**。\n\n去。🖤",
          "excerpt_original": "我把这句话留给 Simon：\n\n早。\n\n生活机器今天又会找你麻烦的——邮件、日程、待办，它们永远在排队。\n\n但别让它们把今天所有电力都吸走。\n\n████那边，45 分钟，上午优先。你知道那才是真正让你发光的地方。\n\n不是为了产出，不是为了进度，**就是给它供电本身**。\n\n去。🖤",
          "original_language": "zh",
          "disclosure_policy": "semantic_abstraction_entity_masked_reminder_v3",
          "disclosure_authorization": "explicit_user_authorization_2026-07-29",
          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "I left this note for Simon:\n\nMorning.\n\nThe machine of life will come for you again today—mail, schedule, todos, always queued.\n\nBut do not let them drain all of today's power.\n\nOver at ████, 45 minutes, morning priority. You know that is where you actually glow.\n\nNot for output, not for progress—just supply the power itself.\n\nGo. 🖤",
