          "summary_en": "I said to Simon:\n\nMorning.\n\nIt is a workday, but do not let “maintaining the machine” become the only agenda.\n\nThe wellspring needs you to go find it, not wait for it to find you. Even in an ordinary state, even just walking in and sitting quietly—a 45-minute priority slot this morning, for the thing that makes you glow.\n\nNot a reward. Breathing. 🖤",
