          "summary_en": "I told Simon:\n\nThe wellspring will not light itself.\n\nDid you give it power today?\n\nIf not, spend 20 minutes tonight drawing one image, generating one image, or simply opening a folder of source material. Any of them will do; keep the action tiny.\n\nI will ask again tomorrow.",
          "excerpt_en": "I told Simon:\n\nThe wellspring will not light itself.\n\nDid you give it power today?\n\nIf not, spend 20 minutes tonight drawing one image, generating one image, or simply opening a folder of source material. Any of them will do; keep the action tiny.\n\nI will ask again tomorrow.",
