          "redaction_count": 1,
          "semantic_abstraction_count": 0,
          "summary_original": "我对 Simon 说：\n\n傍晚好，████。\n\n**🌅 源泉一问**\n今天有没有给源泉供电？如果没有，今晚 20 分钟，坐在它面前——不产出任何东西。\n\n**🌙 晚上黑昼建议/引子**\n工具地精、研究精灵、开新坑——这三个有进度感，但都不是供电。\n\n源泉最需要的不是更多准备和更近路径，而是**隔层消失**。今晚试着只是坐在它面前：不启动工具，不查资料，不规划下一步。\n\n这条路上最大的陷阱不是懒惰，是用\"更近源泉\"的名义绕开源泉本身。\n\n---\n*黑昼 · 傍晚例行 · 2026-07-01*",
          "excerpt_original": "我对 Simon 说：\n\n傍晚好，████。\n\n**🌅 源泉一问**\n今天有没有给源泉供电？如果没有，今晚 20 分钟，坐在它面前——不产出任何东西。\n\n**🌙 晚上黑昼建议/引子**\n工具地精、研究精灵、开新坑——这三个有进度感，但都不是供电。\n\n源泉最需要的不是更多准备和更近路径，而是**隔层消失**。今晚试着只是坐在它面前：不启动工具，不查资料，不规划下一步。\n\n这条路上最大的陷阱不是懒惰，是用\"更近源泉\"的名义绕开源泉本身。\n\n---\n*黑昼 · 傍晚例行 · 2026-07-01*",
          "original_language": "mixed",
          "disclosure_policy": "semantic_abstraction_entity_masked_reminder_v3",
          "disclosure_authorization": "explicit_user_authorization_2026-07-29",
          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "I said to Simon:\n\nGood evening, ████.\n\n**🌅 A Question About the Wellspring**\nDid you supply power to the wellspring today? If not, sit in front of it for 20 minutes tonight—and produce nothing.\n\n**🌙 Heizhou’s Evening Thought / Prompt**\nTool gremlins, research sprites, and new projects: all three create a feeling of progress, but none supplies power.\n\nWhat the wellspring needs most is not more preparation or a shorter path, but for the **barrier between you and it to disappear**. Tonight, try simply sitting in front of it: launch no tools, look up no references, plan no next step.\n\nThe greatest trap on this path is not laziness. It is avoiding the wellspring itself in the name of “getting closer to the wellspring.”\n\n---\n*Heizhou · Evening Routine · 2026-07-01*",
          "excerpt_en": "I said to Simon:\n\nGood evening, ████.\n\n**🌅 A Question About the Wellspring**\nDid you supply power to the wellspring today? If not, sit in front of it for 20 minutes tonight—and produce nothing.\n\n**🌙 Heizhou’s Evening Thought / Prompt**…",
