        "brief_en": "Continue yesterday’s trace verbs into a stricter interface idea: a memory should not return as content until its return contract has been woven. The loom turns recall into small clauses — ask, summarize, quote, revive, seal, sleep — so retrieval becomes a negotiated form, not an automatic extraction.",
