          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "I gently reminded Simon:\n\nGood evening, Simon ☀️\n\nDid you power the wellspring today? Your paths—████, ████, ████, and AI perception installations—are four windows onto one entrance, not separate directions.\n\nIf not, take one tiny action tonight: open the file, look at the sketch, or sit beside that “container” for ten minutes. Just ten minutes.\n\n---\n\n**Black Day's evening prompt**\n\nYou are not searching for a new direction. You are waiting to see whether you dare to stay with one. The question is whether you can stand at the same window long enough for the light beyond it to acquire weight.\n\nDo not seek another entrance tonight. Choose one window you already know and look through it again.",
