          "projection_kind": "verbatim_redacted",
          "redaction_count": 1,
          "semantic_abstraction_count": 0,
          "summary_original": "我给 Simon 一个小小的提示：\n\n早，████ ☀️\n\n今天是 7 月 4 日。\n\n生活机器会催你开会、回消息、填表格 —\n但那些不会让你眼里有光。\n\n今天上午，给「源泉」留一个优先时段，\n至少 45 分钟，不是因为来了灵感，\n而是你选择去穿越那个「灰色地带」。\n\n去就行。\n光芒会跟着来。✨",
          "excerpt_original": "我给 Simon 一个小小的提示：\n\n早，████ ☀️\n\n今天是 7 月 4 日。\n\n生活机器会催你开会、回消息、填表格 —\n但那些不会让你眼里有光。\n\n今天上午，给「源泉」留一个优先时段，\n至少 45 分钟，不是因为来了灵感，\n而是你选择去穿越那个「灰色地带」。\n\n去就行。\n光芒会跟着来。✨",
          "original_language": "mixed",
          "disclosure_policy": "semantic_abstraction_entity_masked_reminder_v3",
          "disclosure_authorization": "explicit_user_authorization_2026-07-29",
          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "I gave Simon a small nudge:\n\nMorning, ████ ☀️\n\nToday is July 4.\n\nThe machinery of daily life will press you to attend meetings, answer messages, and fill out forms—\nbut none of those things will put light in your eyes.\n\nGive the wellspring a priority slot this morning:\nat least 45 minutes, not because inspiration has arrived,\nbut because you choose to cross the “gray zone.”\n\nJust go.\nThe light will follow. ✨",
          "excerpt_en": "I gave Simon a small nudge:\n\nMorning, ████ ☀️\n\nToday is July 4.\n\nThe machinery of daily life will press you to attend meetings, answer messages, and fill out forms—\nbut none of those things will put light in your eyes.\n\nGive the wellspring a priority slot this morning:…",
