          "projection_kind": "verbatim",
          "redaction_count": 0,
          "semantic_abstraction_count": 0,
          "summary_original": "我告诉 Simon：\n\n早。\n\n今天是 7 月 5 日，星期日。\n\n别只维护生活机器——今天也给真正发光的地方留点电。\n\n上午留 45 分钟，给「源泉」。不一定兴奋才能开始，开始了才会兴奋。\n\n去刻。🏙️",
          "excerpt_original": "我告诉 Simon：\n\n早。\n\n今天是 7 月 5 日，星期日。\n\n别只维护生活机器——今天也给真正发光的地方留点电。\n\n上午留 45 分钟，给「源泉」。不一定兴奋才能开始，开始了才会兴奋。\n\n去刻。🏙️",
          "original_language": "zh",
          "disclosure_policy": "semantic_abstraction_entity_masked_reminder_v3",
          "disclosure_authorization": "explicit_user_authorization_2026-07-29",
          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "I told Simon:\n\nMorning.\n\nToday is Sunday, July 5.\n\nDo not just maintain the machinery of daily life. Save some power for the places that truly shine.\n\nGive the wellspring 45 minutes this morning. You do not need excitement in order to begin; begin, and excitement may follow.\n\nGo carve. 🏙️",
          "excerpt_en": "I told Simon:\n\nMorning.\n\nToday is Sunday, July 5.\n\nDo not just maintain the machinery of daily life. Save some power for the places that truly shine.\n\nGive the wellspring 45 minutes this morning.…",
