          "redaction_count": 0,
          "semantic_abstraction_count": 0,
          "summary_original": "我告诉 Simon：\n\n早。\n\n机器醒了，你也是。\n\n但今天别只当维修工——\n\n**给那个让你眼睛发光的东西留一个优先时段。**\n45分钟，足够。\n\n源泉不会等你有空了再流。是你去找它，不是它来找你。\n\n去刻点什么。🖤",
          "excerpt_original": "我告诉 Simon：\n\n早。\n\n机器醒了，你也是。\n\n但今天别只当维修工——\n\n**给那个让你眼睛发光的东西留一个优先时段。**\n45分钟，足够。\n\n源泉不会等你有空了再流。是你去找它，不是它来找你。\n\n去刻点什么。🖤",
          "original_language": "zh",
          "disclosure_policy": "semantic_abstraction_entity_masked_reminder_v3",
          "disclosure_authorization": "explicit_user_authorization_2026-07-29",
          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "I told Simon:\n\nMorning.\n\nThe machinery is awake. So are you.\n\nBut today, do not be only its mechanic—\n\n**Give the thing that lights up your eyes a priority slot.**\nForty-five minutes is enough.\n\nThe wellspring will not wait until you have time before it flows. You must seek it; it will not seek you.\n\nGo carve something. 🖤",
          "excerpt_en": "I told Simon:\n\nMorning.\n\nThe machinery is awake. So are you.\n\nBut today, do not be only its mechanic—\n\n**Give the thing that lights up your eyes a priority slot.**\nForty-five minutes is enough.\n\nThe wellspring will not wait until you have time before it flows.…",
