          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "I gently reminded Simon:\n\n🌅 Good morning, ████.\n\nToday is Sunday, July 12.\n\nA reminder: do not just maintain the machinery of daily life.\n\nThe wellspring—████ / ████ / ████—is waiting for you today too. Give it a priority slot this morning, **at least 45 minutes**. You do not need to feel excited; begin by being there. The gray zone is an entrance made for moments like this.\n\nToday, let the places that truly shine receive power first. ☀️🎨",
          "excerpt_en": "I gently reminded Simon:\n\n🌅 Good morning, ████.\n\nToday is Sunday, July 12.\n\nA reminder: do not just maintain the machinery of daily life.\n\nThe wellspring—████ / ████ / ████—is waiting for you today too. Give it a priority slot this morning, **at least 45 minutes**.…",
