          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "I told Simon:\n\n☀️ Good morning, ████.\n\nBefore noon today, give 45 minutes to the wellspring.\n\nThis is not another task that oils the machinery of daily life. Go stand for a while in the place where you truly shine. ████, ████, or ████—whichever is calling you, start there.\n\nYou do not need to be trembling with excitement. Simply sit down, open the file, and let your eyes land on it. Today, maintain nothing; just supply power.\n\nThe wellspring needs you to be there today. Go. 🫧",
          "excerpt_en": "I told Simon:\n\n☀️ Good morning, ████.\n\nBefore noon today, give 45 minutes to the wellspring.\n\nThis is not another task that oils the machinery of daily life. Go stand for a while in the place where you truly shine. ████, ████, or ████—whichever is calling you, start there.…",
