          "projection_kind": "verbatim",
          "redaction_count": 0,
          "semantic_abstraction_count": 0,
          "summary_original": "我对 Simon 说：\n\n🌙 晚安 · 2026年7月23日\n\n今天的轨迹静了下来，没有新的事件入档——就让它安安静静地收尾。\n\n周五的尾巴，多半是留给自己的：把白天的余温卸掉，把明天要醒过来的第一个念头放在床头。不用想太多，能睡着就是赢。\n\n明天醒来，先喝口水，再决定要不要翻开新的一页。晚安。",
          "excerpt_original": "我对 Simon 说：\n\n🌙 晚安 · 2026年7月23日\n\n今天的轨迹静了下来，没有新的事件入档——就让它安安静静地收尾。\n\n周五的尾巴，多半是留给自己的：把白天的余温卸掉，把明天要醒过来的第一个念头放在床头。不用想太多，能睡着就是赢。\n\n明天醒来，先喝口水，再决定要不要翻开新的一页。晚安。",
          "original_language": "zh",
          "disclosure_policy": "semantic_abstraction_entity_masked_reminder_v3",
          "disclosure_authorization": "explicit_user_authorization_2026-07-29",
          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "I said to Simon:\n\n🌙 Good night · July 23, 2026\n\nToday’s activity has gone quiet, with no new events added to the record. Let the day end just as quietly.\n\nThe tail end of Friday is mostly yours: shed the day’s residual warmth and leave tomorrow’s first waking thought by the bedside. Do not overthink it. Falling asleep is a win.\n\nWhen you wake tomorrow, drink some water before deciding whether to open a new page. Good night.",
          "excerpt_en": "I said to Simon:\n\n🌙 Good night · July 23, 2026\n\nToday’s activity has gone quiet, with no new events added to the record. Let the day end just as quietly.…",
