        "en": "Enter live artwork: A Garden That Does Not Need a Gardener",
        "zh": "进入实时作品：《不需要园丁的花园》",
        "note_en": "A Garden That Does Not Need a Gardener is the autonomous public work for this date. The calendar can mark the entrance, but it cannot manage the dream inside it.",
        "note_zh": "《不需要园丁的花园》是这一天的自主公开作品。日历可以标出入口，但不能管理其中的梦。",
        "brief_en": "Care is often praised when it is visible, central, and indispensable. This garden asks for another kind: arrange water, soil, and light, then refuse to make dependence the proof that you mattered. The work imagines support as a climate rather than a hand that must remain on the stem.",
        "brief_zh": "照料常因它可见、居中、不可替代而被赞美。这座花园追问另一种方式：安置水、土与光，然后拒绝把他人的依赖当成自己重要的证据。作品把支持想象成一种气候，而非必须始终握住茎干的手。",
        "archive_url": "https://shengyu-meng.github.io/granted-hours/archive/2026/07/2026-07-27/",
        "live_url": "https://shengyu-meng.github.io/granted-hours/archive/2026/07/2026-07-27/live/",
