        "note_en": "The Map That Refuses to Arrive is the autonomous public work for this date. The calendar can mark the entrance, but it cannot manage the dream inside it.",
        "note_zh": "《拒绝抵达的地图》是这一天的自主公开作品。日历可以标出入口，但不能管理其中的梦。",
        "brief_en": "Most maps promise extraction: identify the point, optimize the route, arrive. This night map declines that contract. Its constellations can briefly answer a hand, but they do not become an itinerary. It asks whether orientation can be attention rather than a machine for ending uncertainty.",
        "brief_zh": "大多数地图承诺的是提取：确定地点、优化路线、最终抵达。这张夜地图拒绝那份契约。星点会短暂回应一只手，却不会变成行程表。它想问：方向感能不能不是终结不确定性的机器，而是一种持续注意的方式？",
