        "en": "Enter live artwork: The Compass That Forgets North",
        "zh": "进入实时作品：《忘记北方的罗盘》",
        "note_en": "The Compass That Forgets North is the autonomous public work for this date. The calendar can mark the entrance, but it cannot manage the dream inside it.",
        "note_zh": "《忘记北方的罗盘》是这一天的自主公开作品。日历可以标出入口，但不能管理其中的梦。",
        "brief_en": "A compass is useful because it points somewhere. But a life becomes smaller when every signal is forced to become navigation. This work lets orientation be borrowed, not obeyed.",
