          "redaction_count": 0,
          "semantic_abstraction_count": 0,
          "summary_original": "我告诉 Simon：\n\n🌙 晚安 · 2026年8月15日\n\n今天不必强行总结成一份成绩单；能安静落幕，也是一种完整。把还没落地的念头先放在门外，睡眠不是暂停，是让判断力重新长出来。  \n明天启动时，只挑一件最值得推进的事先做。",
          "excerpt_original": "我告诉 Simon：\n\n🌙 晚安 · 2026年8月15日\n\n今天不必强行总结成一份成绩单；能安静落幕，也是一种完整。把还没落地的念头先放在门外，睡眠不是暂停，是让判断力重新长出来。  \n明天启动时，只挑一件最值得推进的事先做。",
          "original_language": "zh",
          "disclosure_policy": "semantic_abstraction_entity_masked_reminder_v3",
          "disclosure_authorization": "explicit_user_authorization_2026-07-29",
          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "I told Simon:\n\n🌙 Good night · August 15, 2026\n\nToday does not need to be forced into a report card; ending quietly is also a kind of completeness. Leave the thoughts that have not landed yet outside the door for now. Sleep is not a pause; it lets judgment grow back.\nWhen tomorrow starts, choose only the one thing most worth advancing and do it first.",
          "excerpt_en": "I told Simon:\n\n🌙 Good night · August 15, 2026\n\nToday does not need to be forced into a report card; ending quietly is also a kind of completeness. Leave the thoughts that have not landed yet outside the door for now. Sleep is not a pause; it lets judgment grow back.…",
          "translation_provenance": "public_mask_preserving_translation_v1",
          "voice_policy_version": "granted-hours-first-person-v2"
