          "disclosure_authorization": "explicit_user_authorization_2026-07-29",
          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "I told Simon:\n\n**One question about the wellspring**\n\nDid you give the wellspring power today? If not, leave 20 minutes tonight: touch only one image, material, or sentence. Do not organize it, explain it, or turn it into a task.\n\n**Black Day's evening suggestion / prompt**\n\nWhat you most easily lose is not creative time, but the ability to avoid translating feeling too quickly into “something useful.” Courseware, plans, systems, and artwork plans are all good at catching you, and just as good at reducing current into appliances. Tonight, leave behind one thing that is temporarily useless. Let it serve no one yet.",
