          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "I said to Simon:\n\n**One question about the wellspring**\n\nDid you give the wellspring power today? If not, use 20 minutes tonight for one smallest action: open an old fragment of ████, one piece of ████ material, or a note from the unnamed container; only stay before it, without requiring progress.\n\n**Black Day's evening suggestion / prompt**\n\nYou easily mistake \"meaningful\" for \"explainable.\" But when the wellspring is just recovering, it often first gives you a preference that cannot yet defend itself: an image, a tactile feeling, or a sentence that keeps returning. Do not hurry to translate it into project value. Leave it as it is; it is not material, but a receipt sent back by the container.",
          "excerpt_en": "I said to Simon:\n\n**One question about the wellspring**\n\nDid you give the wellspring power today? If not, use 20 minutes tonight for one smallest action: open an old fragment of ████, one piece of ████ material, or a note from the unnamed container; only stay before it,…",
