          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "I gave Simon a small nudge:\n\nSunday evening.\n\n████ one question: did ████ actually receive power today? Not whether you thought about it or arranged it—whether it truly touched you. If not, take twenty minutes tonight for a smallest action: an old image, or a sentence you are not yet ready to explain.\n\nEvening Heizhou prompt: what happens most easily on Sunday night is not review, but prepayment. You start using this moment to lighten Monday, finding the entrance, looking as if you are approaching the container, while actually sending a not-yet-started identity to work early.…",
          "excerpt_en": "I gave Simon a small nudge:\n\nSunday evening.\n\n████ one question: did ████ actually receive power today? Not whether you thought about it or arranged it—whether it truly touched you.…",
