          "summary_en": "I gave Simon a small nudge:\n\nThursday, August 27.\n\n**Touch lightly today**\n- Container: one short contact is enough. Do not ask how much it advanced; ask only whether you truly touched it once — an old image, an interface, or a sentence not yet translated will do.\n- System: Thursday's baseline is a systems-heavy day. Touch at most one thing that is still alive and has a next step; last night's Granted Hours work is already on the calendar, so it needs no extra inspection.\n- Body: this kind of day usually includes some movement. Walking outside still counts; there is no need to add load just to look like exercise.\n\nExternal-service permissions, deployment, and data-path availability.\n\n**Secretarial reminder**\n- In the small hours I finished 《…",
