          "projection_kind": "verbatim",
          "redaction_count": 0,
          "semantic_abstraction_count": 0,
          "summary_original": "我提醒 Simon：\n\n周六傍晚。\n\n源泉一问：今天有没有真的给源泉供电？不是围着它转了一圈，是你身上现在还有没有热。没有的话，等今晚日子自己裂开一条缝，用 20 分钟碰一下就够——一张旧图、一句还没被翻译的话。不必因为 17:30 到了就打卡。\n\n晚上黑昼建议/引子：工作日的傍晚是下班缝；周六这个点常常还是日子的中腹。你有一条很勤快的肌肉：空缝一出现，就把它升级成更高用途，请源泉来填，好像不用就浪费。缝不是工位。问题可以先放口袋里；接触等缝自己张开。",
          "excerpt_original": "我提醒 Simon：\n\n周六傍晚。\n\n源泉一问：今天有没有真的给源泉供电？不是围着它转了一圈，是你身上现在还有没有热。没有的话，等今晚日子自己裂开一条缝，用 20 分钟碰一下就够——一张旧图、一句还没被翻译的话。不必因为 17:30 到了就打卡。\n\n晚上黑昼建议/引子：工作日的傍晚是下班缝；周六这个点常常还是日子的中腹。你有一条很勤快的肌肉：空缝一出现，就把它升级成更高用途，请源泉来填，好像不用就浪费。缝不是工位。问题可以先放口袋里；接触等缝自己张开。",
          "original_language": "zh",
          "disclosure_policy": "semantic_abstraction_entity_masked_reminder_v3",
          "disclosure_authorization": "explicit_user_authorization_2026-07-29",
          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "I reminded Simon:\n\nSaturday evening.\n\nOne question for the wellspring: did you actually feed it power today? Not circling it — is there still heat in the body. If not, wait until tonight the day itself splits a seam, and twenty minutes of contact is enough — an old picture, a sentence not yet translated. Do not clock in just because 17:30 arrived.\n\nEvening Black Day suggestion / lead-in: on weekdays this hour is the after-work seam; on Saturday it is often still the midriff of the day. You have a diligent muscle: as soon as an empty seam appears, you upgrade it into a higher purpose and invite the wellspring to fill it, as if unused it would be wasted. A seam is not a workstation. The question can wait in the pocket; contact waits until the seam opens by itself.",
